 "statement": "The redundant indexed-circuit construction retains every original actual six-member equation, appends unknown t-bit/range/borrow/constant-product gates and extends the SAME known original witness to1989 variables/2223 equations/6905 terms of degree at most2, with1989 single-variable mutation refusals and original row replay. Four fixed Fp101 membership domains and all24024 original toy signed-pair/target decisions agree with the declared canonical indexed extensions. Labels are supplied only by the witness-extension qualification harness. This is construction/extension evidence with zero solver invocations, not root discovery, a compiler soundness theorem, cost comparison, useful yield or exponent evidence. Prime-field contracts and all signed standing remain unverified."
